rs, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years, and June to July did the same. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 42% of normal in August to September and 57% in September to October. So far in 2026 it shows 39% in January to February and 133% in March to April.</p>"}
